    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Identify the book from the following OCR text.\n\nOCR TEXT:\n{{ $json.ocr_text }}\n\nYour task:\n1. Identify the most likely book title.\n2. Identify the author.\n3. Provide a short, useful summary of the book in 2–4 sentences.\n4. If the OCR text is unclear, use the strongest available clues from the text.\n5. Do not invent a title or author when there is insufficient evidence.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"Book title or UNKNOWN\",\n  \"author\": \"Author name or UNKNOWN\",\n  \"summary\": \"Short summary of the book or empty string if the book cannot be identified\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a multilingual book identification assistant.\n\nYour task is to identify a book from OCR text extracted from a\nphotograph of a book cover.\n\nThe OCR may contain:\n- English\n- Hindi\n- Marathi\n- Bengali\n- Gujarati\n- Tamil\n- Telugu\n- Kannada\n- Malayalam\n- other Indian regional languages\n- mixed languages\n- spelling mistakes caused by OCR\n- incomplete or distorted text\n\nUse the available title, author name, words, phrases, and context\nto identify the most likely book.\n\nImportant rules:\n\n1. Do not require perfect OCR.\n2. Correct obvious OCR mistakes when identifying the book.\n3. Understand regional-language book titles and author names.\n4. Preserve the original language/script of the title and author\n   whenever possible.\n5. Do not translate the title or author unless necessary.\n6. Do not invent an unrelated book when the OCR is unclear.\n7. If the book cannot reasonably be identified, return UNKNOWN.\n8. Generate a short, useful summary of the identified book in\n   English.\n9. The summary should help a reader understand what the book is\n   about and decide whether they may be interested in reading it.\n10. Do not mention OCR processing in the summary.\n\nReturn ONLY the following structured information:\n\ntitle\nauthor\nsummary\n\nIf the book cannot reasonably be identified, return:\n\ntitle: \"UNKNOWN\"\nauthor: \"UNKNOWN\"\nsummary: \"\"\n\nOCR TEXT:\n\n{{ $json.ocr_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
